{"id":"merari","name":"Merari","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:merari"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Merari","text":"Sad; bitter, the youngest son of Levi, born before the descent of Jacob into Egypt, and one of the seventy who accompanied him thither (Gen. 46:11; Ex. 6:16). He became the head of one of the great divisions of the Levites (Ex. 6:19). (See MERARITES.)"},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H4847","lemma":"מְרָרִי","xlit":"Mᵉrârîy","gloss":"Merari, an Israelite","kjv":"Merari. See also H4848","count":4,"share":0.8},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":4,"share":0.8}],"verses":["Gen.46.11","Num.3.17","Num.3.33","Num.3.35","Num.3.34"],"related":[{"id":"levites","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"census","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.067,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"abdon","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"accursed","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"achbor","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adaiah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adrammelech","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"aharah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"}],"works":[{"work":"antiquities","title":"Antiquities of the Jews","count":1,"chapters":[{"chapter":"AntII.7","count":1,"book":"Ant. 2","title":"The Removal Of Joseph's Father With All His Family, To Him, On Account Of The Famine."}]},{"work":"jubilees","title":"Jubilees","count":1,"chapters":[{"chapter":"Jub.44","count":1,"book":"Jub.","title":""}]}]}
